#: a814c458702c4c4daeab8fa18923a434
msgid "The SBUS pin can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-acns-cm4pilot.rst:97
#: f6094b50827347eb8cdddf359c897afe
msgid "To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 receivers a UART must be configured and used (USART1 , UART4, or UART6) and their ``SERAILx_PROTOCOL`` set to \"23\"."
msgstr ""

